    "body": "@keithamus Thanks for the prompt response here. \n\nWhile #11040 prompted the ARIA WG to look into this space, I felt the direction being discussed there diverges somewhat from the intent of this issue. That issue focused on adding a general accessor for ElementInternals, whereas this one was intended to initiate collaboration between the WHATWG and the ARIA WG, starting from a narrowly scoped, ARIA-specific angle.\n\nThat said, I’m happy to continue the discussion in either WHATWG issue if that’s preferable.",
